{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56418","headline":"缺题 · 萧沼","name":"缺题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"生年一半在燕支，容颜沙场日夜衰。\n萧关不隔乡园梦，瀚海长愁征战期。\n容颜日日老金{彳数}，砂碛年年卧铁衣。\n白草城中春不入，黄花戍上应长飞。\n（伯三六一九卷。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧沼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56418.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56418","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}